    "created_at": "2016-04-18T14:06:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-18T14:06:16Z",
    "body": "Quick search in httparchive reveals such usage, e.g.:\n\nhttp://www.15min.lt/\n\n``` js\ntouch: (function(){\n                try { \n                    document.createEvent('TouchEvent');\n                    return true;\n                } catch(e) { \n                    return false;\n                }\n            })()\n```\n\nhttp://www.cnbc.com/\n\n``` js\nvar isMobile=(function(){var mobile=false,evt;try{evt=document.createEvent('TouchEvent');mobile=true;}catch(e){}\nreturn mobile;}());\n```\n",
